<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>The Agenda · May 5, 2026</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink:        #1a1a1a;
    --ink-soft:   #2a2a2a;
    --paper:      #f6f1e6;
    --paper-2:    #efe8d6;
    --rule:       #1a1a1a;
    --blue:       #38b6ff;
    --blue-deep:  #1a9de8;
    --blue-soft:  #d9eeff;
    --pink:       #ff66c4;
    --pink-hot:   #ff3eb6;
    --pink-soft:  #ffd9ee;
    --slate:      #5a5a5a;
    --serif:      Georgia, "Times New Roman", "Liberation Serif", serif;
    --sans:       "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, "Liberation Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body {
    background: #d2cdbf;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  }
  .page {
    width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(26,26,26,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 4px 4px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .page > * { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

  .top-stripe { height: 5px; background: var(--pink); }

  /* ============ LOGO — height-capped ============ */
  .logo-banner {
    width: 100%;
    height: 220px;
    background: var(--blue);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .logo-banner img {
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ============ MASTHEAD ============ */
  .masthead {
    padding: 16px 56px 14px;
    border-bottom: 3px double var(--rule);
  }
  .masthead-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--slate);
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .masthead-top .right { color: var(--pink-hot); }
  .masthead-top a.eyebrow-link {
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--pink-hot);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
  .masthead-top a.eyebrow-link .arrow {
    margin-left: 4px;
  }

  .title-block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }
  .title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .title .the {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .title .agenda { font-size: 56px; display: block; }
  .title .accent-bar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 56px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--pink);
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-left: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-width: 460px;
  }
  .title-side {
    flex: 1;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .full-agenda-link {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--pink-hot);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  .full-agenda-link .arrow {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .meta-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .meta-row strong {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .meta-row a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blue-deep);
  }

  /* ============ HEADLINES ============ */
  .headlines {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .headline {
    padding: 14px 28px 14px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
    position: relative;
  }
  .headline:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .headline .kicker {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .headline .figure {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 50px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .headline .figure::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: 28px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--pink);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .headline .caption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 280px;
  }

  /* ============ SECTIONS ============ */
  .section { padding: 18px 56px 4px; }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .section-header::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--pink);
  }
  .section-num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .section-eyebrow {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  /* ============ FEATURE STORIES ============ */
  .feature {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 4px 0 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.18);
  }
  .feature:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 6px; }
  .feature-side {
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.18);
    padding-right: 24px;
  }
  .feature-tag {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .feature-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .feature-id {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
  }
  .feature-body { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink); }
  .feature-body p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .feature-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .feature-body strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, var(--pink-soft) 60%);
    padding: 0 2px;
  }
  .pullquote {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--pink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .pullquote .label {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .drop-cap::first-letter {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 50px;
    float: left;
    line-height: 0.85;
    padding: 6px 8px 0 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
  }

  /* ============ STUDY (BLUE BLOCK) ============ */
  .study {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 26px 32px;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: start;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 4px solid var(--pink);
  }
  .study-mark {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .study-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .study-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .study-body {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .study-id {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  /* ============ REGULAR ITEMS (list of compact spotlights) ============ */
  .regular-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .regular-item {
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .regular-item .ri-tag {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .regular-item .ri-name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }
  .regular-item .ri-id {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .regular-item .ri-text {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ============ CONSENT LIST (austere by default) ============ */
  .consent-summary {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: -6px 0 8px;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .consent-summary strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .consent-list-minimal {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.25);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.25);
  }
  .consent-meta {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin: -8px 0 12px;
  }
  .consent-list {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.25);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.25);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .consent-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 3px 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.10);
  }
  .consent-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* Visual group break: extra padding only, no extra line */
  .consent-row.group-break {
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  /* Total row at the bottom of the financial group */
  .consent-total-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 14px 4px 4px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .consent-total-row .total-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  }
  .consent-total-row .total-amount {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .consent-footnote {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }
  .consent-row .marker {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--slate);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .consent-row.flagged .marker {
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .consent-row .name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .consent-row .id {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--slate);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .consent-row .why {
    grid-column: 2 / 4;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-top: -3px;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .consent-row .why::before {
    content: "";
    display: none;
  }

  /* ============ CIVIC NOTES (masonry: items flow into 2 columns by height) ============ */
  .civic {
    column-count: 2;
    column-gap: 32px;
    column-rule: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.18);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .civic-block {
    break-inside: avoid;             /* keeps a block from splitting across columns */
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: inline-block;           /* required for column flow + break-inside */
    width: 100%;
  }
  .civic-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .civic-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  /* Side-block label uses blue */
  .civic-block.side .civic-label { color: var(--blue-deep); }

  .proc-list { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .proc-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr auto;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26,26,26,0.10);
  }
  .proc-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .proc-row .num {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--pink-hot);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .proc-row .name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }
  .proc-row .when {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--slate);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .civic-block .body {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .civic-block .body strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .civic-block .id {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  /* ============ COMPRESSED 3-PANEL FOOTER ============ */
  .footer-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1.4fr;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-top: 5px solid var(--pink);
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .fs-panel {
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
  .fs-panel:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .fs-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pink);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .fs-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--paper);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .fs-headline .accent { color: var(--blue); }
  .fs-body {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(246,241,230,0.92);
  }
  .fs-body a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blue);
  }
  .fs-body strong {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .fs-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6px 14px;
  }
  .fs-meta-cell {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .fs-meta-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    padding-top: 8px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .fs-editor {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(246,241,230,0.78);
  }
  .fs-editor a {
    color: var(--blue);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .fs-editor .signature {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .fs-editor .signature .pink { color: var(--pink); }
  .fs-editor .signature .wesley {
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, rgba(255,102,196,0.35) 60%);
    padding: 0 3px;
  }
  .bottom-stripe { height: 5px; background: var(--pink); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="top-stripe"></div>

  <div class="logo-banner">
    <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='assets/logo.png') }}" alt="Cory J. Wesley · Oak Park Trustee" />
  </div>

  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="masthead-top">
      <div><a class="eyebrow-link" href="https://www.oak-park.us/Government/Meetings/Village-Board-Agendas-Minutes-Videos">Read the full agenda packet<span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
      <div class="right">Issue 03 · May 12, 2026</div>
    </div>

    <div class="title-block">
      <h1 class="title">
        <span class="the">The</span>
        <span class="agenda">Agenda<span class="accent-bar"></span></span>
      </h1>
      <div class="title-side">
        <p class="subtitle">A reader’s guide to the May 12 Village Board meeting — three study sessions on dispatch reform, pavement, and police oversight, plus a cohousing escrow waiver and a 7-item consent agenda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-row">
      <div><strong>Convening</strong>Tuesday, May 12 · 7:00 PM</div>
      <div><strong>Where</strong>Council Chambers, Village Hall</div>
      <div><strong>How to Join</strong>In person, or virtually via the Clerk at <a href="mailto:clerkwaters@oak-park.us">clerkwaters@oak-park.us</a></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="headlines">
    <div class="headline">
      <div class="kicker">The Big Number</div>
      <div class="figure">3</div>
      <div class="caption">Study sessions on the agenda — CESSA mental-health dispatch, pavement management, and the CPOC semi-annual report.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="headline">
      <div class="kicker">On the Table</div>
      <div class="figure">18</div>
      <div class="caption">Closed-session meeting dates spanning June 2024–March 2026 — a 21-month minutes backlog clears in one consent vote.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="headline">
      <div class="kicker">For the Calendar</div>
      <div class="figure">4</div>
